zWYU - While You're Up, for RimWorld 1.6
========================================

zWYU is a DERIVED WORK: a modernization / port of the RimWorld mod "While You're Up"
(a.k.a. "Jobs of Opportunity", "While You're Up / PUAH+") to RimWorld 1.6.
It is not an unrelated original invention. The concepts, settings, defaults, geometry rules and
many code fragments originate from that mod, and are used under its license (below).

